{"ID":"20240118151055-ark14gl","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151055-ark14gl","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151055-ark14gl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151055-4u7ikrx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122141450-juxij0y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122141430-5udar0s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:57,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:57\u0026#125;","title":"242石龙子（蜥蜴）","type":"doc","updated":"20240202095551"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151055-4u7ikrx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151055-4u7ikrx","updated":"20240202095041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，寒，有小毒。治五癃，邪结气，破石淋，下血，利小便水道。生川谷及山石间。一名蜥蜴。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141403-4af78bs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141403-4af78bs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】今之蜥蜴。处处有之 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141407-3hp8ta1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141407-3hp8ta1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味咸性寒，有小毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141408-8dpqdj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141408-8dpqdj0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】有利尿通淋下血之效，妊妇不得服用。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141410-sybhb3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141410-sybhb3v"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】主治五癃结气，利小便水道，破石淋，下血。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141411-0evz1y9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141411-0evz1y9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般一条至两条，烧灰研粉酒服。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141412-lhf182e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141412-lhf182e"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】有寒利者禁忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141402-0ayamqr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141402-0ayamqr"}},{"ID":"20240122141412-1rzf7ox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141412-1rzf7ox"}},{"ID":"20240122141413-q36d099","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141413-q36d099","updated":"20240122141420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"242石龙子就是我们的蜥蜴。味是咸的，寒的，有小毒。专门治五癃，小便不通。"}]},{"ID":"20240122141420-d4y9x16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141420-d4y9x16","updated":"20240202095308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜥蜴味咸性寒。咸味的，它也是寒凉的，讲白话寒的药，药性是寒的是消炎的啦，所以一个人说小便不通，刺痛，滴滴沥沥黄加很红加刺痛这是热症，脸是红的脉是瘦的这是热症，用寒药，消炎嘛。同样一个老先生跑来，脸色苍白没有力气，小便滴滴答答他是摄护腺肥大，里面是虚寒的，这个时候你不要给他吃石龙子，越吃小便越不出来，因为它是寒凉的药，这要大热的药下去才行。所以寒热要分的清楚。"}]},{"ID":"20240122141430-5udar0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141430-5udar0s","updated":"20240202095551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有的时候小便不出来不单单是膀胱结石啊，有的是踢足球不小心被踢到，踢到那边。很痛。过去中医有桃核承气汤可以使用，抵挡汤。这个石龙子也可以下血，膀胱被踢到阴部里面有出血，淤血堵到啦小便不出来。小便不出来很痛苦的，这时候吃什么都吃下去，你相信我哦，你一天不小便，我告诉你这个可以利小便出来，保证你要吃下去，只要利小便出来就好了。这个时候很痛苦的，小便排不出来很危险。"}]},{"ID":"20240122141438-jo1xu13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141438-jo1xu13","updated":"20240202095345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙子蜥蜴很小，你不要抓那个马来西亚很大的蜥蜴，那个那个比鳄鱼还大，你说“老师那个最好”。很小一只，药房里就有的卖，拿出来壁虎一样小小一只。有利尿通淋下血的功能。孕妇不要吃，因为它性很寒。孕妇在怀孕中间的时候和怀孕之前，我们要让容易怀孕的时候我们都要让她热。子宫太冷不容易受孕。反过来说寒凉的药是可以避孕的，热性的药是可以助孕的。这样分开来就可以了。当然我们避孕的效果绝对不如西医，我讲过你要找什么东西毁坏，西医最厉害。要找什么建立，一定要找中医。毁坏你要找西医，他们一级棒，他毁坏他还不承认。就好像小孩子玻璃打破了，杯子打破了他还不承认。你说小孩坏不坏？我都看到了还不承认。很坏哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240122141450-juxij0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141450-juxij0y","updated":"20240122141452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它能通淋下血。那一般来说你开处方一条两条，不会说一钱两钱。哪有一条长的刚好一钱。一条两条。一般来说做成灰。这是石龙子。"}]}]}